# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Things that must not be shared
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# Remembers the last file, folder and columns you had open -- which means it
# contains the full paths on your own computer (your user name, your OneDrive).
# Harmless locally, but not something to publish.
.labfit_session.json

# Your measurements. Keep the note explaining what the folder is for.
data/*
!data/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Figures exported from the app into this folder. The ones in examples/
# are kept on purpose.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
/*.png
/*.pdf
/*.svg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Junk from Windows, Excel, OneDrive and editors
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*
.~lock.*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
